<!--Post: 11201--><!--Time: 1110498970-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11201"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Victoria<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Victoria<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 3:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t like this turn of events. I thought medical records were private.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11201-->
<!--Post: 11204--><!--Time: 1110499816-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11204"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 4:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The news reports went back and forth on this, here&#39;s the way I think from all the mess this is how it went, When LE scanned the disc and found rader&#39;s name they went and took a copy of his daughter&#39;s DNA and compared it to the crime scene, when they arrested him, they were running her DNA not his. She didn&#39;t know anything about it, and I agree that they way they took it was wrong.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11204-->
<!--Post: 11210--><!--Time: 1110503806-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11210"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iceteajan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iceteajan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 5:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There are plenty of things in one&#39;s personal garbage that can scream out one&#39;s DNA -- especially well . . .  &#34;female things&#34;!  &#40;Sorry folks!&#41; <BR> <BR>Once tossed out, it is legally &#34;garbage&#34; and I believe they can conviscate it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
