</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 5:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.freerepublic.com/focus/f-news/1355483/posts" target=_top>http://www.freerepublic.com/focus/f-news/1355483/p osts</a> <BR>lol IceTea that&#39;s not how they got her Dna, but you are right, anything you thown away can be confiscated as evidence.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11212-->
<!--Post: 11274--><!--Time: 1110549994-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11274"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hmmm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hmmm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 11, 2005 - 6:06 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Can&#39;t they use a &#34;search warrent&#34; or something like that for medical records also?  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11274-->
<!--Post: 11277--><!--Time: 1110550757-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11277"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
